                                                "sense_id": "e748a52f-a76e-3ab1-ac68-9f3138441813",
                                                "text": "Its fare is a mix of fast-food staples like burgers and Chickenjoy, along with more regional dishes like smoked bangus, or milkfish — a national symbol of the Philippines — served with vinegar and pepper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee350dbb-4633-4cde-8133-983686139344",
                                                "sense_id": "e748a52f-a76e-3ab1-ac68-9f3138441813",
                                                "text": "The Taiwanese milkfish industry has faced troubles in recent years, and in 2011 a state-owned PRC firm placed an order for the fish from the town of Syuejia (Xuejia) in Tainan County."
                                            }
